{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793821949056046002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"albinistic-selenite-tick","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"1db75b5f18121cd69082202a04726bd1bf4ff15341d151a899525f470dc1eac7","event_uuid":"c7efc425-6eba-4f07-8d3b-28ca3adfd494","position":{"commit_sha":"1c90b27148df2d015d2faaa5ce2099a5db4cf8c4","position":"1793821910678156001-c7efc425-6eba-4f07-8d3b-28ca3adfd494"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"997380e6a060a0dd1aad9706a1b0e26b7f7a7b968bbc6fdec1d79e3c6062762b","event_uuid":"e540056b-e4bc-4059-b9bd-13993de987d9","position":{"commit_sha":"c1d806e09497337266bea8eb4f804dab70662678","position":"1793821949056046001-e540056b-e4bc-4059-b9bd-13993de987d9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793821910678156001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"e540056b-e4bc-4059-b9bd-13993de987d9","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"98bc-13ff-2f80-48ba"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`rebar store fsck --help` documents `--only ONLY` as \"check only the named ticket(s)\" (`src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/core/repair.py:49`), but `fsck_cli` (`src/rebar/_commands/fsck.py:332-348`) accepts exactly one value, `--only=stale-channel`, and only together with `--repair`. Observed 2026-11-04 at e0bfa4e5154:\n\n- `rebar store fsck --repair-snapshots --dry-run --only 77b6-868f-f4bd-461f` -> `Error: --only requires a value` (the space-separated form documented by argparse is rejected outright).\n- `... --only=77b6-868f-f4bd-461f` -> `Error: unknown --only value '77b6-868f-f4bd-461f'`.\n\nAn operator following the help text to scope a snapshot repair to one ticket (respirable-trapezial-ekaltadeta) cannot, and has to run the whole-store pass instead.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `rebar store fsck --help` describes `--only` as what the command actually accepts, or the command accepts what the help describes; a test pins help text and parser behaviour together.\n- [ ] `--only <value>` (space-separated) and `--only=<value>` behave the same.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e395-114c-aee9-42a5","ticket_type":"bug","title":"store fsck --help says --only takes ticket ids; the command accepts only --only=stale-channel","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c7efc425-6eba-4f07-8d3b-28ca3adfd494","e540056b-e4bc-4059-b9bd-13993de987d9"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793821949056046002,"uuid":"647e78cf-dff9-4f43-b145-83a652f62d39"}